please cry for us?

00:04:49.922 --> 00:04:52.758
-Oh, God. Okay. I could try.

00:04:52.758 --> 00:04:54.227
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:54.227 --> 00:04:55.561
You know, it depends, um --

00:04:55.561 --> 00:04:57.362
-Do you want me to set you up?
-Yeah, you know.

00:04:57.362 --> 00:04:59.499
You have to think about,
what are we talking about?

00:04:59.499 --> 00:05:01.834
-All right. I'll do it with you.
Am I going to make you laugh?

00:05:01.834 --> 00:05:04.236
This is how I act.

00:05:04.236 --> 00:05:06.172
-Let's see what we get to.
-All right.

00:05:06.172 --> 00:05:08.140
-Here we go.
-[ Stammers ]

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:09.975
-Yeah.
Jimmy, is everything okay?

00:05:09.975 --> 00:05:11.577
-[ Voice breaking ]
Yeah, I guess so.

00:05:11.577 --> 00:05:14.046
I'm just -- I just can't --

00:05:14.046 --> 00:05:16.415
Baby Yoda is so cute.

00:05:16.415 --> 00:05:18.217
[ Laughter ]

