you did this thing.

00:06:27.186 --> 00:06:28.454 line:0%
I think you do it annually.

00:06:28.454 --> 00:06:31.090 line:0%
It's an England vs. the World
soccer match.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:32.425
-Soccer Aid. Yes.
-Yes.

00:06:32.425 --> 00:06:34.560
-It's called Soccer Aid
for UNICEF.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:38.331
And it's basically
this extraordinary event

00:06:38.331 --> 00:06:39.965
at a big soccer stadium
in England.

00:06:39.965 --> 00:06:41.400
It was Old Trafford,

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:43.870
where Manchester United play
this summer in June.

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:49.041
And you -- basically former pros
and keen amateurs like myself.

00:06:49.041 --> 00:06:50.743
-Yeah, I mean,
you're really good.

00:06:50.743 --> 00:06:52.512
-No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.
Come on, Jimmy.

00:06:52.512 --> 00:06:54.813
I am -- I'm a --
I said "keen amateur," like...

00:06:54.813 --> 00:06:56.315
-I mean, no, but, no, no, no --
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:06:56.315 --> 00:06:57.417
No, I'm playing up
against people

00:06:57.417 --> 00:06:59.285
