and Francesco Totti...

00:06:59.285 --> 00:07:01.120
-Not them, yeah.
-...you know, Roberto Carlos.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.154
Yeah. So...
-Yeah.

00:07:02.154 --> 00:07:03.389
Not counting them out.
-Yeah.

00:07:03.389 --> 00:07:04.457
-You're the best.
-[ Chuckles ]

00:07:04.457 --> 00:07:06.091
-I mean, yeah.
-Yeah, well, you know.

00:07:06.091 --> 00:07:07.760
-If you don't mention the other
players, you're number one.

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:09.128
-Exactly. Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:07:09.128 --> 00:07:10.396
-Forget about Paul Scholes.

00:07:10.396 --> 00:07:12.664
Anyway, so --
so it was this summer,

00:07:12.664 --> 00:07:14.667
