the rest of the world.

00:07:14.667 --> 00:07:16.536
And we raise loads of money
for children.

00:07:16.536 --> 00:07:19.037
-Good for you.
-Yeah. It was -- It was fun.

00:07:19.037 --> 00:07:20.472
[ Cheers and applause ]
And it was fun.

00:07:20.472 --> 00:07:23.643
I played --
I played for England,

00:07:23.643 --> 00:07:25.978
not for the rest of the world.
[ Light laughter ]

00:07:25.978 --> 00:07:27.512
And...
-Did you win?

00:07:27.512 --> 00:07:29.348
-We didn't, sadly.
-Yeah, okay. The world won.

00:07:29.348 --> 00:07:30.849
-The world won.
-Okay. The world won.

00:07:30.849 --> 00:07:32.251
