defensive midfielder.

00:07:59.311 --> 00:08:01.880
And I look up to see
who I'm man-marking,

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:04.684
and it's the fastest man alive.
[ Laughter ]

00:08:04.684 --> 00:08:06.184
-That's like -- That's the best.
-It's like, "Okay, good luck."

00:08:06.184 --> 00:08:07.553
-That's the best challenge
in the world.

00:08:07.553 --> 00:08:08.654
-"Good luck." Yeah, yeah, yeah.
-You're like -- Yeah.

00:08:08.654 --> 00:08:10.022
-Absolutely amazing.
-Yeah.

00:08:10.022 --> 00:08:12.492
-I mean -- he's -- when you --
when you hear --

00:08:12.492 --> 00:08:14.594
you see
the legs coming towards you,

00:08:14.594 --> 00:08:15.694
it's like an express train.

00:08:15.694 --> 00:08:16.695
-No. Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:08:16.695 --> 00:08:19.064
-He's the fastest.
Yeah. Here's you.

00:08:19.064 --> 00:08:21.000
I think you're kind of
holding your own there.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.200
-He's floating, you notice.

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:23.369
He's --
-Yeah.

00:08:23.369 --> 00:08:24.770
-He's, like,
still walking on water.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:26.538
-Yeah.
-Let me see.

00:08:26.538 --> 00:08:28.708
There's one of you --
Here's what I wanted to show.

00:08:28.708 --> 00:08:31.210
You should frame this.
-[ Chuckling ] Okay.

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:32.778
-This is you running alongside
Usain Bolt.

00:08:32.778 --> 00:08:34.012
Look at this.
-Look at this guy.

00:08:34.012 --> 00:08:35.247
-Not bad.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:35.247 --> 00:08:38.084
-[ Laughs ]
-Not bad. Respect!

00:08:38.084 --> 00:08:41.387
-Yeah. I mean...
-The form. The form. The form.

00:08:41.387 --> 00:08:44.924
-Yeah, I like to think --
I don't know if it's the angle,

00:08:44.924 --> 00:08:47.093
