I'm ahead of him.

00:08:47.093 --> 00:08:49.094
-Yeah, that's exactly right.
Thank you. That's --

00:08:49.094 --> 00:08:50.329
That's all that matters.
Frame this.

00:08:50.329 --> 00:08:51.597
-But the determination,
honestly --

00:08:51.597 --> 00:08:53.132
and I said to him afterwards --
-He's the best.

00:08:53.132 --> 00:08:54.967
-He's the best. Like,
he's a real football fan --

00:08:54.967 --> 00:08:56.335
soccer fan -- sorry --
I should say.

00:08:56.335 --> 00:09:00.272
-No, of course.
-And I love running.

00:09:00.272 --> 00:09:02.775
And it's a big part of my life.
And he's just an icon for me.

00:09:02.775 --> 00:09:04.810
I mean, he's like
an international sports icon.

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:06.679
-Yeah.
-And to go against him

00:09:06.679 --> 00:09:08.347
was just like such a thrill
and privilege.

00:09:08.347 --> 00:09:10.182
-No, but he's running next to
you, going like, "That's Loki!"

00:09:10.182 --> 00:09:12.618
[ Laughter ]
-He had a few laughs.

00:09:12.618 --> 00:09:14.420
You know, he -- I think
I gave him a few problems,

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:17.189
'cause, obviously,
he's unbelievably quick.

00:09:17.189 --> 00:09:18.724
-Yeah.
-And so people just want

00:09:18.724 --> 00:09:19.792
to swing the ball over to him,

00:09:19.792 --> 00:09:21.093
and he'll put it
in the back of the net.

00:09:21.093 --> 00:09:22.895
But -- But I was --
I was -- I stuck to him.

00:09:22.895 --> 00:09:24.062
You know, I held my own.
-You did a great job.

00:09:24.062 --> 00:09:25.898
-Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:25.898 --> 00:09:28.767
I want to talk about --

00:09:28.767 --> 00:09:30.636
Let's talk about "Loki"
while we -- we can do it now.

00:09:30.636 --> 00:09:32.371
-We're here. We're here, yeah.
-We're allowed to talk about it.

00:09:32.371 --> 00:09:34.406
-We're allowed to talk about it.
-Season 2 was great!

00:09:34.406 --> 00:09:36.308
-Thank you. Thank you.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:36.308 --> 00:09:39.111
-It was great!
-Thank you so much.

00:09:39.111 --> 00:09:40.579
-And we couldn't discuss
Season 2,

00:09:40.579 --> 00:09:41.880
but now we can discuss it.

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:43.782
The season finale is --

00:09:43.782 --> 00:09:45.784
you can get the whole Season 2
on Disney+ right now.

00:09:45.784 --> 00:09:46.718
I don't want to spoil it.

00:09:46.718 --> 00:09:47.987
No spoilers.
-Yeah.

00:09:47.987 --> 00:09:49.321
-If you're watching,
we will not spoil it.

00:09:49.321 --> 00:09:51.223
But what can we say --

00:09:51.223 --> 00:09:53.125
what can we say
about the finale?

00:09:53.125 --> 00:09:55.828
-I mean, if you haven't seen it,
no, I will not spoil it for you.

00:09:55.828 --> 00:10:00.499
But I will say this -- it --
it all comes full circle.

00:10:00.499 --> 00:10:02.634
[ Audience oohs ]
And...

00:10:02.634 --> 00:10:05.037
-Yeah. That's a great --
Well, you know how to --

00:10:05.037 --> 00:10:07.139
He knows how to do it. Yeah.
He knows how to do it.

00:10:07.139 --> 00:10:08.808
-Yeah. I mean,
it is a kind of -- it's --

00:10:08.808 --> 00:10:10.409
it's the conclusion to Season 2.

00:10:10.409 --> 00:10:12.778
It's also a conclusion
to seasons 1 and 2.

00:10:12.778 --> 00:10:14.713
It's also the conclusion to --

00:10:14.713 --> 00:10:20.018
to 6 films and 12 episodes
and 14 years of my life.

00:10:20.018 --> 00:10:22.187
It's -- And so -- And in --
I think, in the finale --

00:10:22.187 --> 00:10:23.421
-Has it been 14 years?
-14 years.

00:10:23.421 --> 00:10:25.191
I was 29 when I was cast.

00:10:25.191 --> 00:10:26.425
I'm 42 now.

00:10:26.425 --> 00:10:28.093
-Wow, bud.
-It's been a journey.

00:10:28.093 --> 00:10:29.428
-Good for you.
Congratulations.

00:10:29.428 --> 00:10:30.929
-Thank you. But -- But --
-You did a great job.

00:10:30.929 --> 00:10:32.398
-Thank you.
-You've done a great job.

00:10:32.398 --> 00:10:34.266
-But in the -- in the finale,

00:10:34.266 --> 00:10:39.705
I do think, in the finale,
there are echoes and resonances

00:10:39.705 --> 00:10:43.175
of every version of Loki
that I've played.

00:10:43.175 --> 00:10:44.610
And I think,
without spoiling it,

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:48.514
I think it all -- the episode is
called "Glorious Purpose."

00:10:48.514 --> 00:10:50.315
-Oh, that's your line.
-And if you remember,

00:10:50.315 --> 00:10:53.051
in the first "Avengers" film,
Loki comes down to Earth,

00:10:53.051 --> 00:10:55.320
looks straight at Sam Jackson
as Nick Fury,

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:56.822
and I say, "I'm Loki of Asgard.

00:10:56.822 --> 00:10:58.757
I'm burdened with
glorious purpose."

00:10:58.757 --> 00:11:00.459
And he's arrogant,
and he's hubristic,

00:11:00.459 --> 00:11:02.594
and he's entitled,
and he's puffed up,

00:11:02.594 --> 00:11:04.529
and he's going to take
over the world.

00:11:04.529 --> 00:11:07.566
And then, you know,
it doesn't go so well for him.

00:11:07.566 --> 00:11:09.101
We've all seen "Infinity War."
[ Laughter ]

00:11:09.101 --> 00:11:11.470
Face-to-face with Thanos.
-Yes.

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:13.372
-Not so glorious.
-Yeah.

00:11:13.372 --> 00:11:14.974
-At the beginning of Season 1,

00:11:14.974 --> 00:11:16.809
Mobius, played by Owen Wilson --
the best ever.

00:11:16.809 --> 00:11:18.877
-He's so good in this.
-So great.

00:11:18.877 --> 00:11:20.312
-He's great, and he's also
really funny in this, too.

00:11:20.312 --> 00:11:21.547
-He's hilarious.
-Yeah.

00:11:21.547 --> 00:11:22.682
-But he basically shows Loki

00:11:22.682 --> 00:11:25.451
that the glorious purpose
was a fallacy.

00:11:25.451 --> 00:11:28.753
And he gets kind of
a second chance.

00:11:28.753 --> 00:11:32.658
And that, I think, was the most
exciting thing about this show

00:11:32.658 --> 00:11:36.028
was seeing Loki try to rethink
and rediscover

00:11:36.028 --> 00:11:38.798
that sense of purpose,
which we can all relate to.

00:11:38.798 --> 00:11:42.234
I think, you know, we all wonder

00:11:42.234 --> 00:11:45.170
if we're in charge
of our own story.

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:46.404
-Yeah.
-You know, can we --

00:11:46.404 --> 00:11:48.707
can a leopard change his spots?

00:11:48.707 --> 00:11:51.242
Do we have any free will?

00:11:51.242 --> 00:11:53.045
And in exercising
your free will,

00:11:53.045 --> 00:11:54.780
you make choices
in your own life.

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:56.081
You get a -- I don't know --

00:11:56.081 --> 00:11:58.216
you get a black coffee
or a latte or a cappuccino.

00:11:58.216 --> 00:11:59.685
That's a choice.
I mean, it's a small choice.

00:11:59.685 --> 00:12:02.121
-It's all choices.
-But, yeah, every -- every --

00:12:02.121 --> 00:12:04.689
every choice you make adds up
to the picture of your life.

00:12:04.689 --> 00:12:08.727
And do those choices
inform your purpose?

00:12:08.727 --> 00:12:11.163
And I think all of us as people
want happy lives,

00:12:11.163 --> 00:12:13.331
but we also want lives
with a purpose.

00:12:13.331 --> 00:12:14.733
And that's really what the show
is talking about.

00:12:14.733 --> 00:12:17.403
-Yeah. I-I-I -- It's very good.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:12:17.403 --> 00:12:20.072
That's a way -- a great way to
describe it without spoiling it.

00:12:20.072 --> 00:12:22.074
-In the end,
it comes back to, like,

00:12:22.074 --> 00:12:24.743
meaning and identity
and family,

00:12:24.743 --> 00:12:26.478
which is really what "Loki"
has always been about.

00:12:26.478 --> 00:12:28.714
It's always been about
purpose and family.

00:12:28.714 --> 00:12:30.749
-There's a lot of fans
that have some --

00:12:30.749 --> 00:12:34.786
some theories about the show
and the finale.

00:12:34.786 --> 00:12:35.888
-Okay.
-And I was thinking maybe

00:12:35.888 --> 00:12:37.356
I could run through
a few theories.

00:12:37.356 --> 00:12:39.691
Again, none of these are true,
maybe -- or maybe they aren't.

00:12:39.691 --> 00:12:40.993
You're going to...
-Okay.

00:12:40.993 --> 00:12:41.993
-...answer the best you can.
-I love a fan theory.

00:12:41.993 --> 00:12:43.162
-Yeah, you don't mind?

00:12:43.162 --> 00:12:44.163
-I don't know how much
I'll be able to say,

00:12:44.163 --> 00:12:45.631
but [chuckles]
I'll give it a go.

00:12:45.631 --> 00:12:47.899
-Okay, one theory --
is there a secret connection

00:12:47.899 --> 00:12:51.536
between "Loki" Season 2
and the film "The Marvels"?

00:12:51.536 --> 00:12:53.939
[ Audience oohs ]
-I -- Ooh.

00:12:53.939 --> 00:12:56.007
[ Laughter ]

00:12:56.007 --> 00:12:58.544
I mean, there are connections.
-Oh.

00:12:58.544 --> 00:13:02.481
-There are -- There are --
some secret, some not so secret.

00:13:02.481 --> 00:13:03.682
-Ooh.

00:13:03.682 --> 00:13:05.317
-Um.
-[ Laughs ]

00:13:05.317 --> 00:13:06.551
I keep saying "ooh"
to everything.

00:13:06.551 --> 00:13:07.653
-Yeah.
-Ooh!

00:13:07.653 --> 00:13:09.622
[ Chuckles ] Ooh!
-I don't know what the --

00:13:09.622 --> 00:13:12.257
what the fans think
the secret connection is.

00:13:12.257 --> 00:13:14.726
-Okay. That's a good --
-I mean...

00:13:14.726 --> 00:13:16.829
-That -- That tells me
that there is no connection.

00:13:16.829 --> 00:13:18.129
[ Laughter ]
-Well...

00:13:18.129 --> 00:13:20.098
My -- My other half
is in "The Marvels,"

00:13:20.098 --> 00:13:21.433
and I'm very proud of her.

00:13:21.433 --> 00:13:22.634
-Yeah, so --
-So, there you go.

00:13:22.634 --> 00:13:24.269
-Yeah.
Congratulations.

00:13:24.269 --> 00:13:26.505
-And that's out this weekend.

00:13:26.505 --> 00:13:27.672
But in terms of secret
connections --

00:13:27.672 --> 00:13:30.409
-Has -- Has Miss Minutes...
-Yeah.

00:13:30.409 --> 00:13:32.844
-...been controlling
everything all along?

00:13:32.844 --> 00:13:35.747
[ Audience oohs ]

00:13:35.747 --> 00:13:37.716
-A good question...

00:13:37.716 --> 00:13:40.452
with many answers.
[ Light laughter ]

00:13:40.452 --> 00:13:43.488
I mean...we're all watching out
for A.I., right?

00:13:43.488 --> 00:13:45.891
A.I. is --
A.I. is the thing that's coming.

00:13:45.891 --> 00:13:52.864
And as sort of like
a slightly borderline malevolent

00:13:52.864 --> 00:13:55.568
A.I. cartoon clock...

00:13:56.802 --> 00:13:58.269
...watch your back.

00:13:58.269 --> 00:14:01.406
[ Laughter ]
-Ohh! Okay.

00:14:01.406 --> 00:14:05.044
Does "Loki" finale set up
the "Deadpool 3" movie

00:14:05.044 --> 00:14:07.979
or the "Avengers: Secret Wars"
movie?

00:14:07.979 --> 00:14:10.649
[ Audience oohs ]

00:14:11.717 --> 00:14:14.987
-I mean, I know
they're making "Deadpool 3."

00:14:14.987 --> 00:14:16.755
And I guess --
-That's not the question, Tom.

00:14:16.755 --> 00:14:18.424
[ Laughter ]

00:14:18.424 --> 00:14:20.893
-Um.
-Okay.

00:14:20.893 --> 00:14:22.394
-I -- I -- It was a --
It's a very good question.

00:14:22.394 --> 00:14:23.795
-Okay.
-And I'm thinking

00:14:23.795 --> 00:14:26.898
of all the answers
I could give it.

00:14:26.898 --> 00:14:28.500
-Yeah. Don't -- I don't want
to get you in trouble.

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:29.834
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:14:29.834 --> 00:14:32.638
-I know that Ryan Reynolds
is in --

00:14:32.638 --> 00:14:34.873
he, like, owns a football team
in the UK --

00:14:34.873 --> 00:14:36.141
soccer team.
[ Light laughter ]

00:14:36.141 --> 00:14:37.309
-No, that's not --
that's not what we asked.

00:14:37.309 --> 00:14:38.811
-We -- We talked about soccer,
right?

00:14:38.811 --> 00:14:40.245
-No, we talked about football.
-Okay?

00:14:40.245 --> 00:14:41.613
-Football --
we it football here.

00:14:41.613 --> 00:14:43.948
-Sorry, sorry, football.
-Yeah, no problem.

00:14:43.948 --> 00:14:45.517
How about this?

00:14:45.517 --> 00:14:48.120
Since Loki knows
how to time slip now,

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:50.622
can he go find someone like...

00:14:50.622 --> 00:14:53.225
Tony Stark, aka Iron Man?

00:14:53.225 --> 00:14:56.861
[ Audience oohs ]

00:14:56.861 --> 00:14:58.296
-This guy.

00:14:58.296 --> 00:15:00.465
This is investigative journalism
right here.

00:15:00.465 --> 00:15:01.933
[ Laughter ]
Um.

00:15:01.933 --> 00:15:08.640
I mean, time slipping
technically gives Loki

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:11.576
some interesting...
[ Drum roll ]

00:15:11.576 --> 00:15:14.446
...moves he can make.
[ Chuckles ]

00:15:14.446 --> 00:15:18.283
I suppose, yeah, he can move
from past, present, future.

00:15:18.283 --> 00:15:20.552
I know that I can time slip.

00:15:20.552 --> 00:15:24.222
I don't know that other
characters can time slip.

00:15:24.222 --> 00:15:26.458
Speaking for myself,
Loki's died a few times,

00:15:26.458 --> 00:15:27.760
come back -- I'm still here.

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:30.295
[ Light laughter ]
So I don't know that --

00:15:30.295 --> 00:15:33.131
that death is necessarily --
I mean, death is --

00:15:33.131 --> 00:15:35.267
death is up for grabs
as an existential question.

00:15:35.267 --> 00:15:36.668
[ Laughter ]
[ Drum roll ]

00:15:36.668 --> 00:15:38.503
Um, that's all I can give you.

00:15:38.503 --> 00:15:39.804
-All right.
That's all he can say.

00:15:39.804 --> 00:15:42.640
Oh, my goodness. Whew!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:45.210
He's good.
You can't -- can't break him.

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.278
Can't break the man.

00:15:46.278 --> 00:15:49.214
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:15:49.214 --> 00:15:50.582
But, Quest -- Quest, can I --

00:15:50.582 --> 00:15:52.284
can I get another drum roll,
please,

00:15:52.284 --> 00:15:55.653
because this is the first time
we're allowed to show a clip

00:15:55.653 --> 00:15:59.158
from an actor's project
on our show for a long time.

00:15:59.158 --> 00:16:00.325
-Yeah.
[ Drum roll ]

00:16:00.325 --> 00:16:02.560
-We waited.
This is history right here.

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:03.696
And thank you, again,
for coming back.

00:16:03.696 --> 00:16:04.797
-Thank you for --
-You know we love you.

00:16:04.797 --> 00:16:06.031
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Thank you.

00:16:06.031 --> 00:16:07.198
-Congrats on another
great season of "Loki."

00:16:07.198 --> 00:16:08.433
I want to show a clip.

00:16:08.433 --> 00:16:10.903
Here's Tom Hiddleston
in Season 2 of "Loki."

00:16:10.903 --> 00:16:12.270
Take a look.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:13.772
-Come on.
They'll have a look at you.

00:16:13.772 --> 00:16:14.873
-Where's that?
I need to be back in there.

00:16:14.873 --> 00:16:16.275
-No, come on.

00:16:16.275 --> 00:16:18.142
-Mobius, I know you're trying
to help me,

00:16:18.142 --> 00:16:19.878
but we should be dealing
with the bigger problem here --

00:16:19.878 --> 00:16:21.013
He Who Remains.

00:16:21.013 --> 00:16:22.948
-I understand,
and we'll get to that.

00:16:22.948 --> 00:16:24.883
In order to do to that,
I need a Loki Who Remains.

00:16:24.883 --> 00:16:27.185
We need to address the fact
that you keep disappearing.

00:16:27.185 --> 00:16:28.821
-What? I don't --
I don't keep disappearing.

00:16:28.821 --> 00:16:30.789
We don't have time --
-Loki...

00:16:33.192 --> 00:16:35.193
You just disappeared.
-I know.

00:16:35.193 --> 00:16:37.329
-And I can't keep looking at it
'cause it's horrible.

00:16:37.329 --> 00:16:39.698
-What? I thought you said
it didn't look that bad.

00:16:39.698 --> 00:16:41.533
-I was lying.
It -- It's terrible.

00:16:41.533 --> 00:16:43.368
Looks like you're being born
or dying

00:16:43.368 --> 00:16:44.670
or both at the same time.

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:46.271
It's really --
It's freaking me out.

00:16:46.271 --> 00:16:47.572
-It's okay. It's okay.
-It looks really painful.

00:16:47.572 --> 00:16:48.706
-It's not that bad.

00:16:48.706 --> 00:16:50.776
I can handle it.
-Come on. How does it look?

00:16:50.776 --> 00:16:52.210
[ Laughter ]

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:54.880
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Tom Hiddleston, everybody!

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:58.584
"Loki" Season 2
is streaming now on Disney+.

